            "YOU KEEP US MOVING.",
            "I BRING PEOPLE BACK."
          ]
        },
        {
          "speaker": "MOSS",
          "portrait": "moss",
          "lines": [
            "A PARTNERSHIP THEN.",
            "NO TRICKS THIS TIME.",
            "KEEP BUILDING TRUST.",
            "THE CITY REMEMBERS."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
